NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This repository does NOT vendor its third-party ROS 2 dependencies.
They are fetched by `dependencies.repos` at pinned commits and modified by
the patches in `patches/`:

  * Ericsii/FAST_LIO_ROS2      - GPL-2.0  (kept external on purpose: vendoring
                                 it would relicense this whole project as GPL)
  * Livox-SDK/livox_ros_driver2 - MIT
  * Livox-SDK/Livox-SDK2        - MIT
